          {
            "title": "Intro 1",
            "id": 79584,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Approfondiamo la gestione delle liste e il modo per aggiornare i dati al loro interno, ad esempio come potrebbero cambiare i dati sulla temperatura durante la giornata.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Any value",
            "id": 79585,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le liste possono memorizzare qualsiasi tipo di dato, che sia una stringa, un booleano, un float o un intero come <code>17</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;17&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>17</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le liste possono memorizzare qualsiasi tipo di dato, che sia una stringa, un booleano, un float o un intero come <code>17</code>.</p><p>Memorizza l'intero <code>17</code> come prima temperatura della lista.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;17&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"17.0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>17</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Index",
            "id": 79586,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [
              {
                "id": "0dd5dbcf-d6bc-4ab0-b5f4-df784d6031d6"
              }
            ],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ogni elemento in una lista ha una posizione numerata chiamata indice.</p><img src=\"0dd5dbcf-d6bc-4ab0-b5f4-df784d6031d6\" visible-if=\"always\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Index",
            "id": 79587,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gli indici iniziano da zero e aumentano con ogni valore successivo. Ciò significa che il secondo elemento di <code>temperatures</code> si trova all'indice <code>[1]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(temperatures[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"20\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>[</code>, seguito da <code>1</code> e infine <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gli indici iniziano da zero e aumentano con ogni valore successivo. Ciò significa che il secondo elemento di <code>temperatures</code> si trova all'indice <code>[1]</code>.</p><p>Visualizza la prima temperatura affinché la console mostri <code>17</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"[\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"temperatures\" /><text value=\"[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"17\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>[</code>, seguito da <code>0</code> e infine <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Access element",
            "id": 79588,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per accedere all'elemento <code>26</code>, scrivi il nome della lista <code>temperatures</code> seguito dall'indice dell'elemento tra parentesi quadre <code>[2]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(temperatures[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[26]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"26\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>temperatures</code>, seguito da <code>[2]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per accedere all'elemento <code>26</code>, scrivi il nome della lista <code>temperatures</code> seguito dall'indice dell'elemento tra parentesi quadre <code>[2]</code>.</p><p>Visualizza l'ultimo elemento della lista, <code>24</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"[\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"temperatures\" /><text value=\"[\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[2]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[4]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[24]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"24\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>temperatures</code>, seguito da <code>[3]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Change value",
            "id": 79573,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per modificare il terzo valore della temperatura nell'elenco, accedici tramite <code>temperatures[2]</code>, poi usa <code>=</code> per assegnargli un nuovo valore come <code>25</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"temperatures[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(temperatures)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"52\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 17, 20, 25, 24 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>temperatures[2]</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>25</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per modificare un elemento della lista, usa il nome e l'indice della lista, poi <code>=</code> per assegnare il nuovo valore.</p><p>Cambia la terza temperatura in <code>25</code> in modo che la lista stampi <code>[17, 20, 25, 24]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"temperatures[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(temperatures)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"temperatures[3]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;25&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[17, 20, 25, 24]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>temperatures[2]</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>25</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Valid index",
            "id": 79589,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nonostante la lista contenga quattro elementi, qui accediamo all'ultimo indice usando <code>3</code>, poiché il conteggio inizia da zero.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"temperatures[\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(temperatures)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[17, 25, 26, 20]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Any value",
            "id": 79571,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quali tipi di valori può memorizzare una lista?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Qualsiasi tipo di valore</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo stringhe</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Qualsiasi tipo di valore.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una lista può memorizzare qualsiasi tipo di valore.</p><p>Che cosa succede quando Python crea <code>[\"Mia\", 3, True]</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Crea una lista contenente una stringa, un intero e un valore booleano.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Rifiuta la lista perché tutti i valori devono essere dello stesso tipo.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Converte tutti e tre i valori in stringhe prima di memorizzarli.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Crea una lista contenente una stringa, un intero e un valore booleano.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Index",
            "id": 79570,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come chiamiamo la posizione di un elemento in una lista?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">L'indice dell'elemento</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il numero dell'elemento</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">L'indice dell'elemento.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La posizione di un elemento in una lista è chiamata indice.</p><p>In <code>colors[1]</code>, che cosa rappresenta <code>1</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">L'indice dell'elemento a cui accedere</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il valore memorizzato nella lista</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Il numero totale di elementi nella lista</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">L'indice dell'elemento a cui accedere.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Start at zero",
            "id": 79555,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale indice ha l'elemento in questo elenco?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Kim&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché <code>Kim</code> ha l'indice <code>0</code> in questa lista?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Kim&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Gli indici delle liste iniziano da <code>0</code>, quindi il primo elemento usa <code>0</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un elemento usa <code>0</code> solo quando è l'unico valore della lista.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Python assegna alle stringhe l'indice <code>0</code> e ai numeri l'indice <code>1</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gli indici delle liste iniziano da <code>0</code>, quindi il primo elemento usa <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Access element",
            "id": 79556,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come si accede a un elemento di questa lista?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cars = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Fiat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tesla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Saab&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>cars[1]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>cars[\"Tesla\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>cars[1]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un programmatore prova <code>cars[\"Tesla\"]</code>, ma le liste usano gli indici per l'accesso. Quale espressione corregge il codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cars = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Fiat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tesla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Saab&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>cars[1]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>cars[2]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"cars[1]\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>cars[1]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Change value",
            "id": 79557,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come aggiorniamo un valore in una lista?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Accediamo al valore tramite il suo indice, poi assegniamo un altro valore</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non possiamo aggiornare i valori nelle liste </item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Accediamo al valore tramite il suo indice, poi assegniamo un altro valore.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiorniamo un valore di una lista accedendo al suo indice e assegnando un altro valore.</p><p>La lista è <code>scores = [8, 6, 9]</code>. Quale riga cambia soltanto il secondo punteggio in <code>7</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>scores[1] = 7</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>scores[2] = 7</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>scores[1] == 7</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>scores[1] = 7</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Valid index",
            "id": 79558,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A quali indici possiamo accedere in una lista con due elementi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code> e <code>1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code> e <code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>0</code> e <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una lista con due elementi ha gli indici <code>0</code> e <code>1</code>.</p><p>Quale espressione tenta di accedere a una posizione oltre la fine di <code>items</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>items[2]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>items[1]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>items[0]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>items[2]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
